---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import FoldDemo from '../components/FoldDemo.astro';
import FoldSequence from '../components/FoldSequence.astro';
import Packs from '../components/Packs.astro';
import TerminalFrame from '../components/TerminalFrame.astro';
import courier from '../assets/courier.png';
import { latestRelease } from '../lib/content';

// The journey's chapters and the gift each one sends home, as the game names them.
const chapters = [
  { title: 'Ink on paper', gift: 'a first leaf', mark: '◆' },
  { title: 'Across the crease', gift: 'a pair of leaves', mark: '◇' },
  { title: 'Gathered layers', gift: 'a berry cluster', mark: '●' },
  { title: 'Uneven edges', gift: 'a folded boat', mark: '△' },
  { title: 'Fold order', gift: 'a small bird', mark: '▾' },
  { title: 'The long brush', gift: 'a longer branch', mark: '◇' },
  { title: 'Mixed brushwork', gift: 'a berry sprig', mark: '●' },
  { title: 'Under the canopy', gift: 'the full canopy', mark: '◆' },
];
---
<Page title="Orifude — A little ink goes a long way" description="Fold a small paper, brush ink through its layers, and unfold the pattern. Orifude is a quiet, offline puzzle game for your terminal.">
  <section class="panel panel-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="wrap hero">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <h1 id="hero-title">A little ink goes a long way.</h1>
        <p class="hero-description">Orifude is a folding and ink puzzle for your terminal. Fold a small sheet, brush ink through its layers, and open it to find the pattern.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="#how-it-works" class="button">See how it folds</a>
          {latestRelease
            ? <a href="/install/" class="text-link">Get Orifude</a>
            : <a href="https://github.com/nuggocto/orifude" class="text-link">Explore the source</a>}
        </div>
        <p class="hero-status">{latestRelease ? `Version ${latestRelease.version} is ready to unfold.` : 'The first release is taking shape.'} <a href="/changelog/">Read the notes</a></p>
      </div>
      <FoldDemo />
    </div>
  </section>

  <p class="crease crease-valley"><span>Take your time. Undo is always there.</span></p>

  <section id="how-it-works" class="panel" aria-labelledby="how-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2 id="how-title">There’s more to a little sheet of paper.</h2>
        <p>A fold brings distant places together. A single brush stroke reaches every layer. The surprise comes when you open it.</p>
      </div>
      <FoldSequence />
      <p class="aside">This is the real first lesson. The opened ink must match the target exactly.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="crease crease-mountain" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="terminal-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2 id="terminal-title">All you need is a little curiosity.</h2>
        <p>Every paper is drawn in your terminal. Use the keyboard to choose a crease, place the brush, and look through the stack before you open it.</p>
      </div>
      <TerminalFrame />
      <div class="notes">
        <div><h3>Leave the clock outside.</h3><p>There is no timer or streak to protect. Undo a mark, start again, or come back another day.</p></div>
        <div><h3>Keep what you solve.</h3><p>Every finished paper becomes a keepsake you can replay one step at a time.</p></div>
        <div><h3>Keep it close.</h3><p>Your progress stays on your computer. Play offline, or bring your own puzzle packs.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="crease crease-valley" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="journey-title">
    <div class="wrap journey">
      <figure class="courier">
        <Image src={courier} alt="A squirrel holding a folded paper sits on a berry branch inside a brush circle." widths={[400, 640, 900]} sizes="(max-width: 800px) 70vw, 460px" width={900} format="webp" quality={84} loading="lazy" />
      </figure>
      <div class="journey-copy">
        <h2 id="journey-title">Forty papers, eight gifts.</h2>
        <p>The journey moves from single marks to layered folds in eight chapters. Finish one, and the squirrel carries a gift home to your branch. Between chapters, open today’s paper or wander the endless garden.</p>
        <ol class="chapters">
          {chapters.map((chapter) => <li><span class="gift" aria-hidden="true">{chapter.mark}</span><span class="chapter-title">{chapter.title}</span><span class="chapter-gift">{chapter.gift}</span></li>)}
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="crease crease-mountain" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <Packs />

  <div class="crease crease-valley" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <section id="get-orifude" class="panel panel-closing" aria-labelledby="get-title">
    <div class="wrap closing">
      <h2 id="get-title">Make yourself at home.</h2>
      <p>{latestRelease ? 'Choose the installation method for your computer, then open your first paper. Orifude plays entirely offline.' : 'The first release is being prepared. Until then, you can explore the code or build Orifude yourself.'}</p>
      <a class="button" href="/install/">{latestRelease ? 'Install Orifude' : 'Build from source'}</a>
      <p class="aside">For Linux, macOS, and Windows.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Page>
